> Seconded.  Please let us have the old interface back.

	I also would like to see, if not the old interface, anyway a much more
playable interface, for one good reason: I have a 9" screen... I have thus some
problems with the message window: sometimes there are more than one line coming
at once and I only get the last one (there is no more the "-- more --" prompt).
I also got text problems: sometimes the text of inventory or ":" windows
disappears or is partially erased. Annoying.
	Also, please bring back the old "option" interface system. The new one
stinks to high heaven: how do you set options initially? There is no way to do
so before you start the game, and then it refuses... There should also be a
command to save the option as "default" (well, in fact, there may be, but I
haven't seen anything about it...).

	Thanks, first for doing NH 3.1 (great job anyway! I love the new wall
patterns and the LOS system!), and then in advance for taking my comments into
consideration for a future patch...

